      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your friends likely lack the tools to understand that true wellness isn't a checklist of achievements but the simple presence of feeling. The emptiness you feel is not a failure but a heavy symptom of deep exhaustion where the body insists on rest even if it feels counterproductive to the world. Please accept that you are not a fraud for having pain, and that a proper doctor can finally listen to you without your having to justify your existence.",
      "source": "target",
