      "content": "Your body is simply prioritizing rest because your mind has been running a marathon you weren't even supposed to fight, which makes the fight against the \"clock\" feeling utterly futile. Professional help isn't designed to be another chore but rather to untangle the knot holding your nervous system in that frozen, gray loop until it can finally move again. You deserve to wake up without this crushing weight, and taking the one step toward professional care is the only valid choice left to escape this endless darkness.",
